<title>USA: U.S. coffee imports - Commerce.</title>
<headline>U.S. coffee imports - Commerce.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Commerce Department report of unroasted, roasted and soluble coffee imports.  (Tonnes):    Oct96   Sept96    Oct95</p>
<p> Unroasted   76,759   81,847   79,535</p>
<p> Roasted	1,850    1,737    1,400</p>
<p> Soluble	1,655    1,933    1,812</p>
<p>Soluble  from Brazil    376	786	607</p>
<p>Note - Coffees include decaffeinated and nondecaffeinated. Soluble includes instant and nonflavored, plus extracts, essences and concentrates.</p>
</text>
